{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2022-12-13 10:00:00', 'title': "KROGER NAMED TO COMPUTERWORLD'S 2023 TOP 100 BEST PLACES TO WORK IN IT", 'text': "CINCINNATI , DEC. 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN NAMED TO\xa0FOUNDRY'S COMPUTERWORLD 2023 BEST PLACES TO WORK IN IT. THIS YEAR'S RECOGNITION MARKS THE FIFTH CONSECUTIVE TIME THAT KROGER'S TECHNOLOGY AND DIGITAL TEAM HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED BY COMPUTERWORLD FOR HAVING AN INNOVATIVE, INDUSTRY-LEADING WORKPLACE CULTURE."}